    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document describes the Namespace Identifier (NID) &quot;mef&quot; for
Uniform Resource Names (URNs) used to identify resources published by
MEF Forum (<eref target="https://www.mef.net" brackets="none"/>).  MEF specifies and manages resources
that utilize this URN identification model.  Management activities
for these and other resources types are handled by the manager of the
MEF Assigned Names and Numbers (MANN) registry.</t>
    </abstract>
